64_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p95JXBqbD5cQ7kNvwFF6tnM&_nc_oc=AdrBnH3xg4aPF12OPioxDP_0p50WpwkDkC67iTwF8bavC3rtfWVUn7LV0JvQVA4sIks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZiQSX3-tTvNJMaGOccKTu-ZwEzrAWKdC_bnTXNVVj-Q&oe=6B085A98"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_20260710_123052 - Copy.png", "id": "1744718143220044", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1744718149886710_6227326422124483575_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBlRbFB4x8AQ7kNvwHOw4H8&_nc_oc=AdoU8VGUYM8s9bpJVqu0q6eFtAEh6ewOVBF2KweE_BVC_KCHBWb6bs_grVv3wmzGl0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrdEawNVNHNEb3KytqwuUJCXNjYOS_Bd3w3gS9WCdmfw&oe=6B0857FD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscapeasset.png", "id": "1764659868202745", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1764659871536078_1971284504079001392_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8j1mm0Gl7YQ7kNvwFoOUuk&_nc_oc=AdpGo7nDZDqRNdsVkQ-BDWLCz1N3NCAp4J7o0qOa8WDGFL9ir5jcdC_qYGmWDFqhovU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnsIDagGkoEPFbKik98fjwkrH7my2bqb_tcXTAIeY5zw&oe=6B086C92"}, "display_name": "Vaelorys", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "RPG", "Fantasy", "Spellcasting"], "long_description": "**Step Into the Abyss. Claim Your Legend.**\n\nVaelorys is under siege. Fight back against invading hordes of monsters in this dark fantasy VR ARPG inspired by loot-driven classics like Diablo and Path of Exile.\n\n{2542007986282367}\n\nExplore dungeons and untamed wilderness, wield powerful gesture-based magic, hunt for legendary loot, and build your hero as you fight to reclaim the realm with your friends.\n\n{916476001459778}\n\n**\u2694\ufe0f Immersive VR Combat & Spellcasting**\n\nDon't just press a button. Use your own hands.\n\nPunch to unleash devastating attacks, strike from range, control groups with area effects, and defend yourself with powerful magic. Master 30+ spells and find the combinations that fit your playstyle.\n\n{1761522361632574}\n\n**\ud83c\udf92 Loot, Gear & Character Builds**\n\nSlay monsters, explore hidden corners, and hunt for rare gear. Upgrade your equipment, increase your power and shape your own build. That perfect drop is just around the next corner!\n\n{1607081580560404}\n\n**\ud83d\udd25 Progression & Exploration**\n\nEarn experience, level up, unlock new abilities, and grow stronger as you venture through hostile wilderness filled with monsters, challenges, and rewards.\n\n{4580455882225668}\n\n**\ud83d\udc79 Epic Boss Battles**\n\nFace powerful enemies and towering bosses. Learn their attacks, master your spells, and defeat them to claim their rewards and continue the fight for Vaelorys.\n\n{1052584521095985}\n\nVaelorys is being built alongside its community. Share feedback, report bugs, suggest features, and help shape the game as it grows.\n\n**The dungeons are calling. Will you emerge as a legend, or become another skeleton in the dark?**\n\nJoin us: https://discord.gg/RprhzVkgAa\n\n{2118532652079569}", "short_description": "Vaelorys is under siege. Fight back against invading hordes of monsters in this dark fantasy VR ARPG where Diablo-style dungeon crawling meets immersive VR combat. Unleash powerful gesture-based spells, carve through relentless enemies, and collect legendary loot. Level up your hero, conquer epic bosses, and fight to reclaim the realm."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vaelorys.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spellbound Studio ApS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vaelorys.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"